  "application_type_full": "Removal/Variation of a condition",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal would likely excessively increase demand for already highly limited public highway parking capacity within the public highway network adjoining the site and the wider Strand on the Green Controlled Parking Zone, result in reduced local public highway parking availability for existing resident parking permit holders and therefore be detrimental to existing and future residents of the area, contrary to London Plan Policies T1 and T6 and Local Plan Policy EC2.  \r\n",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal would likely increase vehicular traffic movements in an area with a medium Public Transport Accessibility Level of '3', harm the efficient management of the constrained local public highway network, result in a recently granted, previously car free residential development becoming a more car intensive development and undermine the promotion of sustainable transport modes in a area with good existing public transport accessibility and walkability, contrary to London Plan Policies T1 and T6 and Local Plan Policy EC2.  "
  ],
